{"seq":26,"slug":"contract-testing-cdc","title":"消费者驱动契约测试","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 消费者驱动契约测试 简介\n\n在微服务架构中，服务间接口的兼容性是系统稳定运行的命脉。当数十甚至数百个服务独立演进、独立部署时，任何一个字段的类型变更、响应结构的调整都可能在运行时引发级联故障。消费者驱动契约测试（Consumer-Driven Contract Testing, CDC）正是为解决这一问题而生的工程实践——它让每个 API 消费者声明自己的真实需求，让提供者在自己的构建流水线中验证这些需求是否仍被满足，从而在部署前而非生产事故后发现破坏性变更。\n\n本知识库适用于有一定微服务开发经验、希望系统掌握契约测试理论与实践的中高级工程师。无论你是平台团队负责质量门禁的工程师，还是业务团队希望减少联调成本的开发者，本知识库都能提供从概念到落地的完整路径。\n\n本 hub 聚焦**服务间接口的消费者驱动验证**。与端到端测试自动化（e2e-test-automation）侧重全链路功能验证不同，契约测试只验证服务边界的结构与语义兼容性，不启动完整调用链。与数据层契约（schema-evolution-data-contracts）侧重数据库 schema 迁移和数据管道的契约治理不同，本 hub 聚焦的是 HTTP/消息接口层面的 API 契约。三者互补但职责清晰。\n\n全书共分为四章：\n\n第一章**基础概念**，建立契约测试的认知框架，厘清 CDC 模式与提供者驱动模式的区别，介绍不同类型的契约及其适用场景。\n\n第二章**工具生态**，深入 Pact 框架的核心工作流与 API，介绍 Spring Cloud Contract 在 JVM 生态的特色方案，以及 Specmatic、Dredd 等替代工具的适用边界。\n\n第三章**高级模式**，覆盖异步消息契约测试、GraphQL/gRPC 等非 REST 协议的契约方案，以及契约版本管理与兼容性策略。\n\n第四章**集成与治理**，讲解如何将契约测试嵌入 CI/CD 流水线，利用 Pact Broker 实现契约的集中治理，以及在组织层面推广 CDC 实践的策略与常见阻力。\n\n推荐学习路径：先通读第一章建立概念基础，然后通过第二章掌握 Pact 框架实战，再学习第三章覆盖异步与非 REST 场景，最后通过第四章完成从工具到组织的全面落地。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础概念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contract-testing-overview","title":"契约测试概述与核心原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/foundations/contract-testing-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"consumer-driven-contracts","title":"消费者驱动契约的核心模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/foundations/consumer-driven-contracts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-types","title":"契约类型与选型策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/foundations/contract-types"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"tools","title":"工具生态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pact-framework","title":"Pact 框架深入实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools/pact-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spring-cloud-contract","title":"Spring Cloud Contract 实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools/spring-cloud-contract"},{"seq":3,"slug":"alternative-tools","title":"替代工具与工具选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools/alternative-tools"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"patterns","title":"高级模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"async-contract-testing","title":"异步消息契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/async-contract-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graphql-grpc-contracts","title":"GraphQL 与 gRPC 契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/graphql-grpc-contracts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-versioning","title":"契约版本管理与兼容性策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/contract-versioning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"integration","title":"集成与治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-pipeline-integration","title":"CI/CD 流水线集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/integration/ci-pipeline-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pact-broker-governance","title":"Pact Broker 治理与平台能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/integration/pact-broker-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"organizational-adoption","title":"组织推广与落地策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/integration/organizational-adoption"}]}]}